OL,3,GNEWSAEstate agent expects housing
OL,4,Amarket to slow
OL,5,
OL,6,FHouses in Guernsey are expected to take
OL,7,Flonger to sell as a result of the
OL,8,Fincrease in interest rates, an estate
OL,9,Fagent has said.
OL,11,FStaff from Savills Guernsey said they
OL,12,Fwere seeing buyers become more
OL,13,Fconservative with their spending habits
OL,14,Fand they thought so-called
OL,15,F"aspirational pricing" of some
OL,16,Fproperties would lead to them staying
OL,17,Fon the market.
OL,19,FIt follows the Bank of England
OL,20,Fincreasing its base interest rate to 4%
OL,21,Ffrom 3.75% as it sought to curb the
OL,22,Finflation driven by the US-Iran war.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,442,440,260,160,0,100
