OL,3,GNEWSAEstate agent expects housing
OL,4,Amarket to slow
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut mortgage broker SPF Private Clients
OL,7,Fsaid Guernsey's housing market was
OL,8,F"resilient", and that it did not expect
OL,9,Fthe changes to have "a massive impact".
